  "question": {
    "text": "If a tangent of slope <math><mn>2</mn></math> of the ellipse <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> passes through the point&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3.75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A tangent of slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> to the ellipse <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Since, it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3.75</mn></math></p>"
  }
